(4, 9, 73, 'Serangoon Clinic - Industrial Design', 'A industrial renovation of a medical clinic in Serangoon, focusing on clever storage. The scope included custom carpentry and custom carpentry.', 'COMPLETED', 82500, '2026-04-19', '2026-10-03', 'Serangoon', 0, '2026-07-11 14:14:09', '2026-08-06 14:14:09'),
